OL,3,GNEWSAJewish leaders call for Fontaines
OL,4,AD.C. gigs to be cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FJewish leaders have called for two
OL,7,FFontaines DC concerts to be cancelled
OL,8,Fover concerns for the Jewish community.
OL,10,FThe Jewish Representative Council of
OL,11,FGreater Manchester (JRC) said it had
OL,12,Fraised "profound concerns" with
OL,13,FManchester City Council about the
OL,14,FHeaton Park gigs on 3 and 4 July 2027.
OL,16,F"At a time of heightened antisemitism,
OL,17,Fcomments and chants linked to the band
OL,18,Frisk importing tensions from the Middle
OL,19,FEast into the UK, with Jewish people
OL,20,Fbecoming the targets," the statement
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
