OL,3,GNEWSAJewish leaders call for Fontaines
OL,4,AD.C. gigs to be cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester City Council said it
OL,7,Funderstood the community's concerns and
OL,8,Fthat addressing them would be "front
OL,9,Fand centre" of preparations for the
OL,10,Fconcerts. Fontaines D.C. has been
OL,11,Fapproached for comment.
